{"sha": "fea89b12546e73c4b44d4d8624c23afbc07536edf623ceb35f7c9d42558c265a", "body": ["\\chapter{随机变量之和与大数定律}\\label{ch:g12:sums}", "", "为什么赌场最终总是获利，民意调查为何有效？因为", "许多独立随机量的平均值波动越来越小。本章", "证明这一点：期望的线性性、", "独立变量的方差可加性、比内梅–切比雪夫不等式，", "以及大数定律。", "", "\\section{随机变量之和}", "", "设 $X, Y$ 为定义在同一有限样本空间", "$\\Omega$ 上的两个随机变量，则和 $X + Y$ 是随机变量", "$\\omega \\mapsto X(\\omega) + Y(\\omega)$.", "", "\\begin{theorem}[期望的线性性]\\label{thm:g12:sums:linearity}", "\\index{期望!线性性}", "对 $X, Y$（均定义在 $\\Omega$ 上）及 $a, b \\in \\R$，有：", "\\[", "\\E(X + Y) = \\E(X) + \\E(Y), \\qquad \\E(aX + b) = a\\E(X) + b .", "\\]", "\\emph{此处无需假设独立性。}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将期望写成对结果的求和。由于", "$\\P(X = x) = \\sum_{\\omega : X(\\omega) = x} \\P(\\{\\omega\\})$，合并各项后", "得 $\\E(X) = \\sum_{\\omega \\in \\Omega} \\P(\\{\\omega\\})\\,X(\\omega)$。于是", "\\[", "\\E(X + Y) = \\sum_{\\omega} \\P(\\{\\omega\\})\\bigl(X(\\omega) + Y(\\omega)\\bigr)", "= \\sum_{\\omega} \\P(\\{\\omega\\})X(\\omega)", "+ \\sum_{\\omega} \\P(\\{\\omega\\})Y(\\omega) = \\E(X) + \\E(Y). \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[独立随机变量]\\label{def:g12:sums:indep}", "称 $X$ 与 $Y$ 为\\emph{独立}\\index{随机变量!独立}的，若", "对所有取值 $x, y$ 有：", "\\[", "\\P(X = x \\text{ 且 } Y = y) = \\P(X = x)\\,\\P(Y = y).", "\\]", "若干变量 $X_1, \\dots, X_n$ 独立，是指", "对每个子族中变量的每一组取值，乘积法则均成立。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:g12:sums:prodexp}", "若 $X$ 与 $Y$ 独立，则 $\\E(XY) = \\E(X)\\,\\E(Y)$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\[", "\\begin{aligned}", "\\E(XY) &= \\sum_{x, y} xy\\;\\P(X = x \\text{ 且 } Y = y)", "= \\sum_{x, y} xy\\,\\P(X=x)\\P(Y=y) \\\\", "&= \\Bigl(\\sum_x x\\P(X=x)\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum_y y\\P(Y=y)\\Bigr). \\qedhere", "\\end{aligned}", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[和的方差]\\label{thm:g12:sums:variance}", "\\index{方差!和的}", "若 $X$ 与 $Y$ \\emph{独立}，则", "\\[", "\\V(X + Y) = \\V(X) + \\V(Y).", "\\]", "更一般地，对独立的 $X_1, \\dots, X_n$，", "$\\V(X_1 + \\dots + X_n) = \\V(X_1) + \\dots + \\V(X_n)$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "利用柯尼希–惠更斯公式（\\cref{prop:g12:randvar:konig}）及线性性：", "\\begin{align*}", "\\V(X + Y) &= \\E\\bigl((X+Y)^2\\bigr) - \\bigl(\\E X + \\E Y\\bigr)^2\\\\", "&= \\E(X^2) + 2\\E(XY) + \\E(Y^2)", "- \\E(X)^2 - 2\\E(X)\\E(Y) - \\E(Y)^2\\\\", "&= \\V(X) + \\V(Y) + 2\\bigl(\\E(XY) - \\E(X)\\E(Y)\\bigr),", "\\end{align*}", "对独立变量，最后的括号项为零", "（见\\cref{prop:g12:sums:prodexp}）。一般情形由归纳法得到。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[二项分布再探]\\label{ex:g12:sums:binomial}", "二项变量 $X \\sim \\mathcal B(n, p)$ 是", "$X = X_1 + \\dots + X_n$，为 $n$ 个独立伯努利变量之和。因此", "从结构上可直接得出：", "\\[", "\\E(X) = np, \\qquad \\V(X) = np(1-p),", "\\]", "无需任何计算即可重新得到\\cref{thm:g12:randvar:binomial}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[样本均值]\\label{prop:g12:sums:mean}", "设 $X_1, \\dots, X_n$ 相互独立且与 $X$ 同分布", "（期望为 $\\mu$，方差为 $\\sigma^2$），令", "$M_n = \\frac{X_1 + \\dots + X_n}{n}$ 为它们的\\emph{样本", "均值}\\index{样本均值}。则", "\\[", "\\E(M_n) = \\mu, \\qquad \\V(M_n) = \\frac{\\sigma^2}{n}, \\qquad", "\\sigma(M_n) = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt n}.", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由线性性得 $\\E(M_n) = \\frac{n\\mu}{n} = \\mu$；由独立性得", "$\\V(X_1 + \\dots + X_n) = n\\sigma^2$，除以 $n$ 时方差", "按 $\\frac{1}{n^2}$ 缩放（见\\cref{prop:g12:randvar:affine}）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "$\\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt n}$ 体现了基本的\\emph{平方根律}：要", "将平均值的波动减半，须使样本量变为原来的四倍。", ""]}